 subtitling per month","Zapier integration"]},{"label":"10 Codes","features":["20 hours transcription and subtitling per month","Zapier integration"]}]','{"rating":"4.78","count":"278"}','["Each additional code adds 2 hours per month of transcription and subtitling; stack unlimited codes","Automatic transcription","Advanced punctuation","Speaker identification","Proofreading helper"]',21,'2026-09-15T19:42:42.949Z');
